    "question": "What is NAD+?",
    "answer": "NAD+ is nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide, a coenzyme involved in cellular energy production, mitochondrial function, DNA repair, and cellular cleanup."
  },
  {
    "question": "Is NAD+ a peptide?",
    "answer": "No. NAD+ is not a peptide. Eden positions NAD+ as a wellness and cellular-support therapy."
  },
  {
    "question": "Is NAD+ available as IV therapy?",
    "answer": "Yes. Eden may offer NAD+ through IV therapy or injectable support depending on your goals, eligibility, and provider recommendation."
  },
  {
    "question": "Who is NAD+ for?",
    "answer": "It is often considered by longevity-focused clients, active-aging adults, functional medicine clients, and people looking for cellular-energy and recovery support."
  },
  {
    "question": "Can NAD+ stack with other Eden protocols?",
    "answer": "Often, yes. Eden may pair NAD+ with IV therapy, glutathione, peptide protocols, recovery care, or functional medicine plans when appropriate."
  },
  {
    "question": "How soon do people notice changes?",
    "answer": "Some clients report energy or clarity changes quickly, while deeper recovery and longevity goals require a longer plan. Individual response varies."
  },
  {
    "question": "Is NAD+ FDA-approved?",
    "answer": "NAD+ is not presented as an FDA-approved drug on this page. Eligibility and fit are determined during clinician consultation."
  },
  {
    "question": "Is this available in Greenwood Village?",
    "answer": "Yes. Eden serves Greenwood Village, DTC, Cherry Hills Village, Centennial, Englewood, Littleton, and the broader south Denver metro."
  },
  {
    "question": "Will NAD+ replace sleep, nutrition, or training?",
    "answer": "No. NAD+ is designed to support a larger care plan, not replace the fundamentals Eden will still review with you."
  },
  {
    "question": "What happens after the consult?",
    "answer": "If you are a fit, Eden recommends the delivery format, timeline, and follow-up cadence that fits your plan."
  }
];
